{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 26, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A STATEMENT THAT RAISES SEVERAL CONCERNS REGARDING ITS VALIDITY AND PRACTICALITY. ON ONE HAND, IT CAN BE ARGUED THAT THIS SENTENCE ENCOURAGES CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE AND PROMOTES A LACK OF RESPECT FOR THE RULE OF LAW. BY IMPLYING THAT INDIVIDUALS HAVE THE AUTONOMY TO CHOOSE WHICH LAWS TO FOLLOW AND WHICH TO IGNORE, THIS STATEMENT CAN LEAD TO SOCIAL UNREST AND CHAOS. FURTHERMORE, IT FAILS TO PROVIDE A CLEAR CRITERION FOR DETERMINING WHAT CONSTITUTES A \"BAD\" LAW, LEAVING IT TO PERSONAL INTERPRETATION AND POTENTIAL MISUSE.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nANOTHER ISSUE WITH THIS SENTENCE IS THAT IT OVERLOOKS THE IMPORTANCE OF THE RULE OF LAW IN MAINTAINING SOCIAL ORDER AND STABILITY. LAWS ARE ENACTED TO PROTECT THE RIGHTS AND INTERESTS OF CITIZENS, AND THEY PROVIDE A FRAMEWORK FOR RESOLVING DISPUTES AND ADDRESSING SOCIAL PROBLEMS. BY ENCOURAGING INDIVIDUALS TO DISREGARD LAWS THEY DEEM \"BAD\", THIS SENTENCE UNDERMINES THE AUTHORITY OF THE LEGAL SYSTEM AND CAN LEAD TO A BREAKDOWN IN SOCIAL COHESION. INSTEAD OF PROMOTING CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE, IT WOULD BE MORE PRODUCTIVE TO ENCOURAGE INDIVIDUALS TO WORK WITHIN THE SYSTEM TO EFFECT CHANGE AND REFORM LAWS THAT ARE DEEMED UNJUST OR INEQUITABLE.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -4.565611743601039e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -9.894321920000948e-06}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.00062851223628968}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.14402322471141815}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.0008061258122324944}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": -1.597391747054644e-05}, {"token": " THE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " LAW", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07